  "body": "Positioned directly opposite the neighbourhood park, this well-appointed Millwater townhouse offers a lifestyle defined by convenience, connection, and low-maintenance living. From here, Silverdale’s shopping centre, Millies Café, local schools, and the Estuary Walkway are all within easy walking distance, making everyday life refreshingly simple.\r\n\r\nDesigned for those who value both comfort and flexibility, the home provides an easy-care base during the week while placing Orewa Beach and the wider peninsula just moments away for weekend relaxation and recreation.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the open-plan kitchen and living area creates a welcoming hub for daily life, flowing seamlessly to a private north-facing patio. Fitted with a louvre system, this outdoor space can be enjoyed throughout the seasons, whether you're hosting friends, enjoying a quiet morning coffee, or dining outdoors with family.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the master suite offers a peaceful retreat, complete with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite. Two additional bedrooms, supported by a second bathroom, provide versatility for families, guests, or those working from home. A separate garage to the rear adds secure storage and enhances the property's sought-after lock-up-and-leave appeal.\r\n\r\nWhen the weekend arrives, Orewa Beach, coastal walkways, cafés, and dining destinations are only a short drive away. Combining low-maintenance practicality with exceptional lifestyle convenience, this home delivers an effortless balance between busy weekdays and relaxed coastal living.",
